{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29794","headline":"戏赠张书记 · 李商隐","name":"戏赠张书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别馆君孤枕，空庭我闭关。\n池光不受月，野气欲沈山。\n星汉秋方会，关河梦几还。\n危弦伤远道，明镜惜红颜。\n古木含风久，平芜尽日闲。\n心知两愁绝，不段若寻环。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}